exports[`service-module > creates the uniform service shape for svc-demo > README 1`] = `
"# svc-demo

The demo engine service: say in one or two sentences what it owns.

Tags: \`type:service\`, \`runtime:node\`.

## Public API

- \`createDemoModule(deps)\`: returns the \`EngineModule\` the composition root registers.
- \`DemoModuleDeps\` (\`src/deps.ts\`): the ports the module needs.
- \`createDemoFakeDeps()\` (\`src/testing.ts\`): fakes for those ports, for specs, the architecture manifest and the HTTP specs.

## Invariants

- Never imports another service or an adapter; cross-service needs are ports wired in the composition root (blueprint 2.2).
- Every mutation is an \`implementAction\` file in \`src/actions/\`; nothing writes through a WritePort outside one (mutation funnel).
- Engine buffers are \`BoundedRing\` or \`BoundedQueue\` (\`@app/bounded-buffers-only\`).

## Proof commands

\`\`\`sh
pnpm nx run-many -t lint typecheck test -p svc-demo
\`\`\`
"
`;

